==Battleground==
*5 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 22.67~26 seconds<sup>680f~780f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*3 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 28~32 seconds<sup>840f~960f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Ryu (Enemy)|Ryu]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
**3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 15.33~18.67 seconds<sup>460f~560f</sup>.
**1 [[Mooth]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

